msgstr ""

#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/helm_upgrades.rst:53
msgid "When an upgrade is triggered, |morpheus| executes the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/helm_upgrades.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Resolves the chart source** — Locates the chart from the configured Git"
